    {
      "category": "offensive",
      "cost": "2",
      "description": "<p>The captain makes two Strikes, one with their rapier and one with their main-gauche (in either order). If both Strikes hit, the ship captain can attempt to Disarm the target.</p>\n<p>Their multiple attack penalty increases only after all the attacks are made.</p>",
